Data Content: 4B CB 94 60 37 4A D2 57 2E 83 47 8C A0 CE 32 B5 F3 5A 3A FE F6 5F A9 6B 2A 41 90 6F 9C 53 84 FC
# Block Security Status: 01 = locked, 00 = not locked
